#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:27
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The uachanger adds a menu to &konqueror; that allows you to change the "
"Browser and Operating System identification on a domain-by-domain basis. "
"This is useful when browsing websites that limit access to those using a "
"particular web browser."
msgstr ""

